%% WISMO Agent — agentic flow (portfolio): classify → extract order → tracking API → grounded status reply
flowchart TD
    A([Inbound: WISMO / tracking]) --> B["Ingest pipeline: dedupe by Message-Id<br/>+ LLM router: wismo + confidence"]
    B --> C["Enrich: hydrate customer + order context<br/>for routing + slot filling"]
    C --> D{Confidence ≥ threshold<br/>+ category = WISMO?}
    D -->|No| Z([Escalation queue: human / copilot])
    D -->|Yes| E["WISMO Agent: structured extraction<br/>+ moderation + response gen"]
    E --> F["NL → order number extraction<br/>(LLM + regex fallback)"]
    F --> G{Order id resolved?}
    G -->|No| H["WooCommerce REST: query orders<br/>by billing_email, recency window"]
    H --> I{Match returned?}
    I -->|No| Z
    I -->|Yes| J
    G -->|Yes| J["AfterShip API: fetch tracking + carrier events"]
    J --> K{200 + trackable payload?}
    K -->|No| Z
    K -->|Yes| L["Generate reply conditioned on<br/>status, ETA, exception codes"]
    L --> M{Auto-send vs<br/>approval queue?}
    M -->|Queue| N[Reviewer approves outbound]
    N --> O([Outbound: tracking summary])
    M -->|Auto| O

    style A fill:#f5f5f5
    style O fill:#e8f5e9
    style Z fill:#fff3e0
